---
import Container from "./Container.astro"
---
<section id="home">
    <div aria-hidden="true"
         class="absolute pointer-events-none inset-0 grid grid-cols-2 -space-x-52 opacity-40 dark:opacity-20">
        <div class="blur-[106px] h-56 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-main)] to-purple-400 dark:from-blue-700"></div>
        <div class="blur-[106px] h-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-sky-300 dark:to-indigo-600"></div>
    </div>
    <Container>
        <div class="relative pt-36 ml-auto w-full text-center mx-auto">
            <h1 class="text-balance font-bold text-5xl md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl">
                Connecting the virtual world with the physical.
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-8 md:pl-20 md:pr-20 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                Want to turn on a light in your room with a command in Minecraft? Or maybe control a LEGO robot with a camera and gestures? Well then, IoTcraft is the tool for you!
                <br/>
                <br/>
                IoTcraft is a platform that allows you to connect your computer to the real world. It allows you to control devices, send commands, and receive data from them. You can use it to create your own projects, or use it with existing ones. The possibilities are endless!
            </p>
            <div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-y-4 gap-x-6">
                <a href="/start"
                   class="relative flex h-11 w-full items-center justify-center px-6 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-full before:bg-[var(--color-main)] before:transition before:duration-300 hover:before:scale-105 active:duration-75 active:before:scale-95 sm:w-max">
                    <span class="relative text-base font-semibold text-white">Get started</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/tea-tech/iotcraft-website" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="relative flex h-11 w-full items-center justify-center px-6 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:rounded-full before:border before:border-transparent before:bg-[var(--color-main)]/10 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:transition before:duration-300 hover:before:scale-105 active:duration-75 active:before:scale-95 dark:before:border-gray-700 dark:before:bg-gray-800 sm:w-max">
                    <span class="relative text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-main)]">Source code on GitHub</span>
                </a>
            </div>
            <div class="py-8 mt-16 border-y border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 sm:flex justify-between space-x-12">
                <div class="text-left mt-4 mb-4">
                    <h6 class="text-lg font-semibold">A whole ecosystem for the
                        taking</h6>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-500">
                        Explore a wide range of integrations for games, electronics, and more. The possibilities are
                        endless!
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-left mt-4 mb-4">
                    <h6 class="text-lg font-semibold">Flexible and decentralized</h6>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-500">
                        Don't want to use our servers or other public ones? That's no problem, you can host your own!
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-left mt-4 mb-4">
                    <h6 class="text-lg font-semibold">Fully open-source</h6>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-gray-500">
                        You can find all of our code on our GitHub Organization. Plus, everything is licensed under the
                        very permissive MIT license.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Container>
</section>
